# Logs & Testing
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
coverage/
test/
# Specs never reach the image: `next build` type-checks every .ts it finds,
# and a spec may import another project's source (result-token.test.ts reads
# billing-service's), which is outside this build context (OPS-1-o-s).
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx

